{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "7eeb65a6a735aef85df50acbf41b80747ca5dedf67bdc67bab58cdab16d0728a", "ja": "うう……も、もう動けないぞ～……。", "zh": "呜呜……本、本人已经动不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "98c217026d7cbaced924a7913a2d77d8d68a29d6aa366e7bee5ef4441e7716f2", "ja": "響、どうしたんだ？\nずいぶん疲れてるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "响，你怎么了？\n看你好像很累的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "b3f0387ba0f9dad419b614d2cc20c17be5531e3f48e08ee452a47e36e31ee197", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nうう……自分、もっと体力がほしい……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n呜呜……真希望本人的体力可以再好一点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "85d2cb0666aa38f48cdd124aabf149a50839e7d3855a927c63354058b74e8bb7", "ja": "そうすれば、さっきのダンスも\nカンペキに覚えられたのに～！", "zh": "这样就能将刚才的舞步\n给完美记下了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b8bdbeab5f9844c2a31b3b3824c61aa3cf2114306b65bb76711fbd935a211a3f", "ja": "またダンスのレッスンでムリしたのか……。\n休みながら頑張るって約束しなかったっけ？", "zh": "你又在练舞时勉强自己了啊……\n你不是跟我约好，努力时也不会忘记休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "f7cf6bffea2fe28b39ba4086d694bbef528f99f1fff7f5c98e970fbc0f04a9bb", "ja": "だから休んでるでしょ～！\nううう、休憩、休憩……。はあ、はあ。", "zh": "本人这不就在休息了嘛～！\n呜呜呜，休息、休息……呼、呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "af0cbea4906d60b60b87d9d8b888fe0696b2b0202cd7f190f039d14c2420bea5", "ja": "よしっ、ちょっと復活した気がする！\n休憩、もう終わりでいいよね？", "zh": "好，感觉体力稍微恢复了！\n休息时间可以结束了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eff77f89d31a4ceaff3e8af0453f5c0fd476103afd13a88f047cd05aca431720", "ja": "通りすがりの俺に聞かれても……。\n本当にいけそうなのか？", "zh": "你问一个刚路过的我是有什么用……\n身体真的不要紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "7f694d6afe5e87e6296b3ded6a7d5f312ced28ea9e6e72b77dc6ef87a06e8a21", "ja": "うう、そういわれると、自信ないぞ……。\nあっ、そうだ！", "zh": "呜呜，被你这么一问，本人也没那个自信回答……\n啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "90453d6800d6dd8f3478aef92983d1b8c1823bc988c38964bd06b7f17e71d945", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}が自分のレッスンに\nついて来る、っていうのはどう？", "zh": "既然这样，{$P$}\n要不要来看本人的练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "c3815d96b03e553d5c8518abe5e86148f5a43d5ce5298676bd4770be598940ee", "ja": "自分がムリそうかどうか、{$P$}なら\nわかるでしょ？　決まりさー！", "zh": "本人到底有没有勉强自己，{$P$}\n应该一看就知道了吧？就这么办啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "943dadf56dc5ad778904710caef7e74651366743441e7bade96e9ceb7bd09807", "ja": "え、決まりなのか？\n一応、これから別の予定が……", "zh": "咦？已经决定好了吗？\n我等会还有别的行程要跑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "e9180854612ffe88dfc4b7583da36f6c32d6449285c3fa48cc64afcfb6652c18", "ja": "よろしくね、{$P$}！\nほら、何してるの？　ちゃんとついて来てよね！", "zh": "交给你啰，{$P$}！\n好了，你楞着做什么？快点跟上啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "edb8d54c0bcbff813e6906effa54beac31789da115a07a790358a3789f9a6bee", "ja": "（案の定というか……\nまだまだ、目を離させてもらえなそうだな！）", "zh": "（该说不出所料吗……\n看来她还不愿意让我放下心呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
